      "derivation_trace": "均值-方差效用：期望收入减等待/空驶成本，再减风险溢价 γσ；风险厌恶系数由文献取 0.6。",
      "sub_question_binding": "Q1"
    },
    {
      "equation_id": "E2",
      "latex": "W(\\lambda_t) = \\frac{\\lambda_t}{\\mu(\\mu-\\lambda_t)}",
      "type": "代数",
      "variables_refs": [
        "V1",
        "V7"
      ],
      "derivation_trace": "M/M/1 平均等待时间，作为司机对队长的信号解读。",
      "sub_question_binding": "Q2"
    },
    {
      "equation_id": "E3",
      "latex": "E_{load}(c) = \\lambda_p\\left[1 - \\frac{(c\\rho)^c}{c!(1-\\rho)}\\Big/\\sum_{k=0}^{c-1}\\frac{(c\\rho)^k}{k!} + \\frac{(c\\rho)^c}{c!(1-\\rho)}\\right],\\quad \\rho=\\frac{\\lambda_p}{c\\mu}",
      "type": "代数",
      "variables_refs": [
        "V6",
        "V8",
        "V9"
      ],
      "derivation_trace": "Erlang-C 阻塞概率补数给出实际服务率；c=2 对应双车道双上车点。",
      "sub_question_binding": "Q3"
    },
    {
      "equation_id": "E4",
      "latex": "G_i = n_i^{short}\\bar r_s + n_i^{long}\\bar r_l - c_w \\frac{W}{1+\\alpha \\phi_i}",
      "type": "递推",
      "variables_refs": [
        "V10",
        "V11"
      ],
      "derivation_trace": "司机单班收益 = 短途单数×短途收入 + 长途单数×长途收入 − 等待成本；优先权按 α 缩短等待。",
      "sub_question_binding": "Q4"
    }
  ],
